<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Jan 97 coconut oil exports 85,000 tns-trade.</title>
<headline>Manila Jan 97 coconut oil exports 85,000 tns-trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine coconut oil exports in January this year reached 85,000 tonnes from the year-ago 74,074 tonnes, trade group United Coconut Association of the Philippines Inc (UCAP) said on Monday citing preliminary data.</p>
</text>
